  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-31T17:18:10.104Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What is shown on an avatar should not be determined by rank but instead by the avatars performance. The current ranking system doesn't make much sense. Since more avatar features are shown from known and trusted users, performance isn't too great. These users are usually the type to have more complex avatars with custom emotes and animations. So it doesn't make sense for the normal safety setting to keep those avatar features on by default for new users and visitors. Another problem caused by the current ranking system is that it brings unwanted elitism to the game. Peoples ranks shouldn't be visible to other players unless they are added as a friend. Changing how the avatar ranking system works could also encourage creators to optimize their avatars.",
